title = "Slice, rung 0: state"
description = "One box of the planet, laid on the real terrain and stepped by the bottom rung alone: matter, energy and phase; nothing moves. No gravity is solved and no wind blows, so this world has no vector field and draws no arrows at all; the picture is the state it was seeded into."
